### Generated Files Example (Entities)
When you add an entity named "Lava Creeper", the following files are produced in the mod source:
- `LavaCreeperEntity.java`
- `LavaCreeperModel.java`
- `LavaCreeperRenderer.java`
- Updates to `MainMod.java` for registration and attributes.
